OL,3,GNEWSAMen guilty of sex attack on lone
OL,4,Agirl on train
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who targeted a 14-year-old girl
OL,7,Ftravelling on her own on a train and
OL,8,Fsubjected her to a prolonged sex attack
OL,9,Fhas been found guilty of rape.
OL,11,FBaryalai Rahimi approached the teenager
OL,12,Fat Sturry station near Canterbury, in
OL,13,FKent, and attacked her on a
OL,14,FLondon-bound train with his friend
OL,15,FMirebadurahman Sadat on 5 February this
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FThe pair from London, who are both
OL,19,FAfghan nationals, carried out what
OL,20,FBritish Transport Police described as a
OL,21,F"heinous and prolonged" attack.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
